    "parsed_response": {
      "turns": [
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Good afternoon, Adrian Tan. Rachel Lim speaking. Is this a convenient moment to talk, or are you still at the office?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Still in office, but door closed already. Can talk now. I've got my details here. [[EV_012]] [[EV_013]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you. We can keep the conversation focused. Has it been difficult finding time away from the business to review your paperwork?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Quite difficult, lah. Staff matters, customer calls, everything comes together. By the time I sit down, usually something else comes up. Anyway, [[EV_014]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "We can discuss that now, without going through unrelated items. [[EV_008]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Hmm, let me think a bit. Usually I only look at my portfolio when the office quietens down. Then the phone rings again. Prefer talking directly rather than having a long email conversation."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "I will keep my explanations concise and pause between topics. [[EV_001]] [[EV_002]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_003]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_004]] [[EV_005]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Let me put my papers in front of me. Desk quite messy today. I've been moving between the warehouse and office, haven't had time to clear anything."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Take your time. [[EV_011]] [[EV_006]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_007]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "I have my notes open. You have the floor."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_018]] [[EV_015]] [[EV_016]] [[EV_017]] [[EV_019]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_009]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_010]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you. Before we finish, is there anything about the way we arrange telephone conversations that you would like me to note?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Just keep them direct like today. Long introductions, I lose track already. If got documents to discuss, better let me have them beforehand, so I'm not searching through emails while talking."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "I can note your preference for concise calls and having relevant paperwork available beforehand. Would you prefer us to arrange a convenient time rather than call unexpectedly?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Better arrange first. Sometimes I'm with customers and cannot pick up. If I know you're calling, I can find somewhere quiet instead of talking while walking around."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "I will note that communication preference. Thank you for taking the time to speak today."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Thanks, Rachel Lim. I'll get back to the office work now. Goodbye."
        }
      ]
    },
